---
layout: base.njk
pageKey: home
description: Symbio AI builds premium websites, redesigns, custom apps, dashboards, AI chatbots, and workflow agents for businesses that want better digital systems.
---

{# ===== Living hero ===================================================== #}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__aurora" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero__grid">
      <div class="hero__content">
        <span class="hero__pill">
          <span class="hero__pill-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Premium websites, apps, dashboards, chatbots, and AI agents
        </span>

        <h1 class="hero__title">
          Turn digital attention into
          <span
            class="hero__rotator"
            data-rotator
            data-words="booked leads,booked calls,new clients,real revenue"
          >
            <span class="hero__rotator-word">booked leads</span></span
          >.
        </h1>

        <p class="hero__lead">
          {{ site.positioning }} Buy one product lane by itself, or have us connect the pieces
          into one clean system.
        </p>

        <div class="hero__cta btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="{{ site.links.demos }}">See the product demos</a>
          <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg" href="{{ site.checkout.url }}">Open checkout</a>
          <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg" href="{{ site.cta.url }}">{{ site.cta.label }}</a>
        </div>

        <p class="hero__trust">
          Founder-led by Mohammed and Ravi. US-based support from NC + CA.
        </p>

        <p class="hero__note">
          Send a link, app idea, dashboard need, or workflow problem. We tell you what we would
          build first and what can wait. <a href="{{ site.links.demos }}">Explore the demos</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__showcase" aria-label="Example Symbio AI website with live lead capture">
        <div class="browser" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="browser__bar">
            <span class="browser__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
            <span class="browser__url">yourbusiness.com</span>
          </div>
          <div class="browser__screen">
            <div class="mini">
              <div class="mini__nav">
                <span class="mini__logo"></span>
                <span class="mini__links">
                  <i>Services</i>
                  <i>Proof</i>
                  <i>Pricing</i>
                </span>
                <span class="mini__cta">Book</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mini__body">
                <div class="mini__copy">
                  <span class="mini__eyebrow">Clean, fast, ready</span>
                  <span class="mini__headline">A premium site<br />people trust.</span>
                  <span class="mini__sub">Clear pages, real calls to action, and mobile-first lead capture.</span>
                  <span class="mini__btn">Start a project</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mini__media" aria-hidden="true">
                  <span class="mini__orb mini__orb--one"></span>
                  <span class="mini__orb mini__orb--two"></span>
                  <span class="mini__phone">
                    <span></span>
                    <strong>24/7</strong>
                    <em>AI intake</em>
                  </span>
                  <span class="mini__service">
                    <strong>Book a consult</strong>
                    <em>3 slots open today</em>
                  </span>
                  <span class="mini__flow mini__flow--a"></span>
                  <span class="mini__flow mini__flow--b"></span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="mini__metrics" aria-hidden="true">
                <span><strong>4.9</strong> rating</span>
                <span><strong>38%</strong> more calls</span>
                <span><strong>24/7</strong> lead capture</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {# Live "lead inbox". main.js animates it; these items are the static
           fallback for no-JS and reduced-motion. #}
        <aside class="lead-inbox lead-inbox--float" aria-label="Example live lead inbox">
          <div class="lead-inbox__bar">
            <span class="lead-inbox__title">
              <span class="lead-inbox__live" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              Lead inbox
            </span>
            <span class="lead-inbox__count">
              <strong data-inbox-count>49</strong> today
            </span>
          </div>

          <ul class="lead-inbox__list" data-inbox>
            <li class="lead">
              <span class="lead__avatar" aria-hidden="true">JM</span>
              <span class="lead__body">
                <span class="lead__name">Jordan M.</span>
                <span class="lead__msg">Do you take new patients this week?</span>
              </span>
              <span class="badge badge--booked">Booked</span>
            </li>
            <li class="lead">
              <span class="lead__avatar" aria-hidden="true">SR</span>
              <span class="lead__body">
                <span class="lead__name">Sarah R.</span>
                <span class="lead__msg">Can I get a quote for a kitchen remodel?</span>
              </span>
              <span class="badge badge--replied">Replied</span>
            </li>
            <li class="lead">
              <span class="lead__avatar" aria-hidden="true">AT</span>
              <span class="lead__body">
                <span class="lead__name">Alex T.</span>
                <span class="lead__msg">Are you open this Saturday?</span>
              </span>
              <span class="badge badge--booked">Booked</span>
            </li>
            <li class="lead">
              <span class="lead__avatar" aria-hidden="true">PK</span>
              <span class="lead__body">
                <span class="lead__name">Priya K.</span>
                <span class="lead__msg">How much for a 5-page website?</span>
              </span>
              <span class="badge badge--replied">Replied</span>
            </li>
            <li class="lead">
              <span class="lead__avatar" aria-hidden="true">TB</span>
              <span class="lead__body">
                <span class="lead__name">Tom B.</span>
                <span class="lead__msg">Can someone call me back today?</span>
              </span>
              <span class="badge badge--booked">Booked</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Who we help (slim strip) ====================================== #}
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="audience" data-reveal>
      <span class="audience__label">Built for</span>
      {% for who in site.whoWeHelp %}
        <span class="chip">{{ who }}</span>
      {% endfor %}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Product studio positioning ===================================== #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow center">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--center" data-reveal>Pick the build</span>
    <h2 class="section__title" data-reveal>Start with the product your business actually needs</h2>
    <p class="section__lead" data-reveal>
      Some clients need a premium website. Some need a custom app, dashboard, chatbot, or AI
      agent. We build the lane that solves the problem, then connect the rest only when it makes
      the business stronger.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row btn-row--center mt-6" data-reveal>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.links.demos }}">Explore product demos</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.cta.url }}">Start with a free scan</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.checkout.url }}">Open checkout</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== How it works =================================================== #}
<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head section__head--center" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--center">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">From missed visitors to booked customers</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">
        A simple, honest process. We look first, explain what matters, then build only what helps.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="grid grid--4">
      <li class="step" data-reveal>
        <span class="step__num">1</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Scan</h3>
        <p class="step__text">
          We review your website, offer, mobile flow, forms, and first impression.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        <span class="step__num">2</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Map</h3>
        <p class="step__text">We show the smallest set of fixes that can move revenue the most.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
        <span class="step__num">3</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Build</h3>
        <p class="step__text">
          We build the product lane that solves the problem: site, app, dashboard, chatbot, or agent.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
        <span class="step__num">4</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Polish</h3>
        <p class="step__text">We tune copy, speed, mobile flow, and calls to action until it feels ready.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="btn-row btn-row--center mt-6" data-reveal>
      <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="about.html">See our vision and process</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== What we build (services teaser) ================================ #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">What we build</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">Clear product lanes. Buy one by itself, or connect them later.</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">
        Start with a premium website, a redesign, a custom app, a dashboard, a chatbot, or an
        AI agent. Each lane has its own price anchor, demo, and scope — and every one is priced
        well below typical agency rates.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="product-menu">
      {% for lane in site.productLanes %}
        <article class="product-card product-card--{{ lane.key }}{% if loop.first %} product-card--primary{% endif %}" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index0 % 3 }}">
          <div class="product-card__topline">
            <span class="eyebrow">{{ lane.eyebrow }}</span>
            <span class="product-card__price">Starts at {{ lane.startsAt }}</span>
            {% if lane.compareAt %}<span class="product-card__compare">{{ lane.compareAt }}</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <h3 class="product-card__title">{{ lane.title }}</h3>
          <p class="product-card__text">{{ lane.summary }}</p>
          <ul class="product-card__features">
            {% for feature in lane.features %}
              <li>{{ feature }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <div class="product-card__actions">
            <a class="card__link" href="{{ lane.demoUrl }}">{{ lane.cta }}</a>
            <span class="product-card__typical">Typical: {{ lane.typical }}</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="btn-row btn-row--center mt-6" data-reveal>
      <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="services.html">See everything we can build</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="pricing.html">Compare pricing anchors</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

